WEBVTT

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.976
whatever you do,
don't keep it to yourself, OK?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.206
(Laughter)

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:36.444
Make sure everybody knows
that I got the answer right,

00:13:36.468 --> 00:13:38.154
because this is my big finish, OK.

00:13:38.178 --> 00:13:41.368
So, without any more stalling,

00:13:41.392 --> 00:13:44.343
here we go.

00:13:44.367 --> 00:13:47.057
I'll start the problem
in the middle, with 57 times 683.

00:13:47.081 --> 00:13:50.223
57 times 68 is 3,400, plus 476 is 3876,

00:13:50.247 --> 00:13:52.517
that's 38,760 plus 171,

00:13:52.541 --> 00:13:55.366
38,760 plus 171 is 38,931.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.976
38,931; double that to get 77,862.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.976
77,862 becomes cookie fission,